# An org with proxies that are deployed NOWHERE. deployment_state and
# revision_drift have nothing to judge (both key off deployments), while
# failed_deployments is measured and flags every proxy. This is the partial
# mix that distinguishes "average over what was measured" from "average over 3".
/organizations	organizations.json	200
/organizations/*/environments/*/stats/*	stats_empty.json	200
/organizations/*/environments	environments.json	200
/organizations/*/apis	apis.json	200
/organizations/*/deployments	deployments.json	200
/organizations/*/operations	operations.json	200
